{"seq":19,"slug":"zero-trust-architecture","title":"零信任架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 零信任架构\n\n2024-2026 年间，68% 的企业数据泄露事件利用了可信内网中的横向移动——攻击者不再突破防火墙，而是窃取身份凭证后在\"受信区域\"内自由穿行。传统城堡护城河模型的根本缺陷已无法回避：一旦越过边界，所有资源均被隐式信任。零信任架构（Zero Trust Architecture, ZTA）正是对这一范式的彻底否定——永不信任，持续验证。\n\n本 hub 聚焦零信任作为一种**架构设计范式**的完整技术体系。我们从 NIST SP 800-207 的七大逻辑组件出发，覆盖身份中心访问、微隔离、设备信任评估、ZTNA/SDP 数据平面、SASE 融合，以及持续监控与成熟度度量。内容面向具有 3-7 年经验的中高级工程师，强调\"为什么这样设计\"和\"如何在生产环境落地\"。\n\n## 本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n- **云安全与合规**（`07_cloud-security-compliance`）：覆盖 IAM 基础、加密、合规框架等广域安全主题，其中 `2_identity-access/2_zero-trust.md` 是零信任的入门概览。本 hub 在此基础上深入架构细节与实施路径。\n- **服务网格**（`14_service-mesh`）：聚焦 mTLS、Sidecar 代理、流量管理等网格层能力。本 hub 在微隔离章节引用其 mTLS 实现，但侧重零信任策略引擎与 PDP/PEP 架构，而非网格本身的数据面。\n- **分布式追踪**（`18_distributed-tracing`）：关注可观测性工具链。本 hub 在持续监控章节复用其信号采集理念，但核心在于信任评估与策略闭环。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n1. **安全基础薄弱者**：先阅读 `07_cloud-security-compliance` 的 IAM 基础与威胁态势章节，再回到本 hub 第一章。\n2. **有网络安全经验者**：直接从第一章（基础原理）开始，按顺序推进至第四章（运营）。\n3. **已有零信任实践者**：可跳至第三章（数据平面）和第四章（运营成熟度），聚焦 SASE 融合与度量体系。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- TCP/IP 网络基础、HTTP/TLS 协议\n- 身份认证与授权概念（OAuth 2.0、SAML、OIDC）\n- 容器与微服务基本架构（Kubernetes 基础即可）\n- 基本的公有云使用经验（任一主流云平台）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perimeter-model-collapse","title":"边界模型的崩塌与零信任范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/foundations/perimeter-model-collapse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nist-reference-model","title":"NIST SP 800-207 参考架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/foundations/nist-reference-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trust-evaluation-engine","title":"信任评估引擎设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/foundations/trust-evaluation-engine"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实施路径","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-centric-access","title":"身份中心访问控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/identity-centric-access"},{"seq":2,"slug":"microsegmentation","title":"微隔离与东西向流量治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/microsegmentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"device-trust","title":"设备信任与端点合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/device-trust"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-plane","title":"数据平面","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ztna-sdp","title":"ZTNA 与软件定义边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/ztna-sdp"},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-aware-proxy","title":"身份感知代理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/identity-aware-proxy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sase-convergence","title":"SASE 架构与网安融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/data-plane/sase-convergence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continuous-monitoring","title":"持续监控与行为分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/continuous-monitoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"maturity-model","title":"零信任成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/maturity-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"零信任迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/migration-strategy"}]}]}